{"id":"wb-5-398","name":"云山屯古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"云山屯村","text":"云山屯村位于中国贵州省安顺市西秀区七眼桥镇，为始建于明初的屯堡，2005年被列为中国历史文化名村，云山屯古建筑群于2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n古建筑群分云山屯和本寨两个相邻的屯堡。云山屯位于山谷中，占地面积约15万平方米，山谷东、南建有两屯门。本寨占地4万余平方米，依山而建。建筑风格兼有江南建筑与当地建筑的特点。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%91%E5%B1%B1%E5%B1%AF%E6%9D%91","revisionId":92544899,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92544899","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7b680d58154535a558f297d7.jpg","title":"Anshun_Yunshantun_2014.04.28_12-54-49.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Anshun_Yunshantun_2014.04.28_12-54-49.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/Anshun_Yunshantun_2014.04.28_12-54-49.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"安顺云山屯村","width":320,"height":213}}